NAME
    Desktop::KDE::Util - Utilities related to KDE

VERSION
    This document describes version 0.001 of Desktop::KDE::Util (from Perl
    distribution Desktop-KDE-Util), released on 2026-06-17.

SYNOPSIS
DESCRIPTION
FUNCTIONS
  which_qdbus
    Usage:

     which_qdbus() -> array

    List paths to qdbus.

    This function is not exported by default, but exportable.

    No arguments.

    Return value: (array)

